  9   4010              ; The VDP's interrupt off (R#1 bit 5 = 0) and the processor's too: the status
 10   4010              ; read in a loop. When bit 7, the frame flag, comes, the border goes black for
 11   4010              ; 8 lines. The border is light green, to tell it from the paper.
 12   4010              seen1   EQU VARS + $10          ; the status that had the flag
 13   4010              seen2   EQU VARS + $11          ; the status read just after it
